cal\t2006\tare\texpected\tto\tincrease\tby\tapproximately\t$23,700,000\tdue\tprimarily\tto\ta\tdecrease\tin\tthe\tdiscount\trate\tto\t5.60%,\twhich\tis\tbased\ton\tthe\tnew\tmeasurement date\tof\tMay\t31st\tdiscussed\tbelow,\tfor\tfiscal\t2006.\tThe\tcomponents\tof\tnet\tpension\tcosts\tfor\teach\tfiscal\tyear\tare\tas\tfollows:\n\n|  |  | 2004 |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  | 2005 | (53\\tWeeks) | 2003 |\n| Service\\tcost | $81,282,000 | $74,934,000 | $51,806,000 |\n| Interest\\tcost | 73,824,000 | 61,162,000 | 50,809,000 |\n| Expected\\treturn\\ton\\tplan\\tassets | (82,613,000) | (61,148,000) | (46,462,000) |\n| Amortization\\tof\\tprior\\tservice\\tcost | 1,760,000 | 1,308,000 | 3,346,000 |\n| Recognized\\tnet\\tactuarial\\tloss | 32,605,000 | 37,697,000 | 15,341,000 |\n| Amortization\\tof\\tnet\\ttransition\\tobligation | — | 279,000 | (552,000) |\n| Net\\tpension\\tcosts | $106,858,000 | $114,232,000 | $74,288,000 |\n\n\t\t\t\t\tThe\tcomponents\tof\tother\tpostretirement\tbenefit\tcosts\tfor\teach\tfiscal\tyear\tare\tas\tfollows:\n\n|  |  | Other\tPostretirement\tPlans |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  |  | 2004 |  |\n|  | 2005 | (53\\tWeeks) | 2003 |\n| Service\\tcost | $477,000 | $422,000 | $318,000 |\n| Interest\\tcost | 488,000 | 402,000 | 372,000 |\n| Expected\\treturn\\ton\\tplan\\tassets | — | — | — |\n| Amortization\\tof\\tprior\\tservice\\tcost | 202,000 | 202,000 | 202,000 |\n| Recognized\\tnet\\tactuarial\\tgain | — | (40,000) | (123,000) |\n| Amortization\\tof\\tnet\\ttransition\\tobligation | 154,000 | 153,000 | 153,000 |\n| Net\\tother\\tpostretirement\\tbenefit\\tcosts | $1,321,000 | $1,139,000 | $922,000 |\n\n\t\t\t\t\tWeighted-average\tassumptions\tused\tto\tdetermine\tbenefit\tobligations\tat\tyear\tend\twere:\n\n|  | Pension\tBenefits | Pension\tBenefits | Other\tPostretirement\tPlans | Other\tPostretirement\tPlans |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  | July\\t2,\\t2005 | July\\t3,\\t2004 | July\\t2,\\t2005 | July\\t3,\